                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On June 13, 1950, after considerable debate in the Bundestag, Chancellor Adenauer
                    accepted Associate membership for the Federal Republic in the Council of Europe
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Documents on International Affairs</hi>, 1949–1950,
                    pp. 359–362).</p>
            </div>
